# React Accessibility Standards

## Semantics
- Use semantic HTML elements first.
- Provide accessible names for interactive controls.

## Forms
- Every input must have a label or `aria-label`.
- Errors must be announced via `aria-live` when applicable.

## Focus Management
- Keep focus visible and consistent.
- Manage focus on dialogs, drawers, and overlays.

## Media
- Provide alt text for images.
- Provide captions or transcripts when needed.
